FIRE RELEASE (KATON) — TECHNIQUE REFERENCE
Konohagakure Jutsu Archive — Chunin+ access

Fire Release is the signature nature of the Land of Fire and the Uchiha
clan. Techniques convert chakra to flame; effective against wind-natured
opponents, weak against water.

Selected Techniques:
- Great Fireball Technique (C-rank): Seals Horse->Tiger; exhale a large
  sphere of flame. A rite of passage for Uchiha clan members.
- Phoenix Sage Fire Technique (C-rank): multiple small fireballs, may
  conceal shuriken within the flames.
- Dragon Flame Technique (C-rank): a focused stream of fire along a
  chakra thread or wire.
- Great Fire Annihilation (B-rank): a sweeping wall of flame (advanced;
  high chakra cost).

Training Note: New students should master chakra-to-flame conversion and
breath control before attempting the Great Fireball. Practice over water
or cleared ground only. See chakra nature training.
